Description: MeeRevive - brings the Nokia N9 back to life (@VARIANT@ build)
 One app that installs and removes the community fixes for Harmattan
 PR1.3: TLS 1.2 patch, emoji font, WebP, system browser for links,
 MeeCast weather with Open-Meteo, and apps written for the N9
 (Waluty, Lyrion, MeeTranslate, HAL 2027, GPS Info, NetMee, AuthMee,
 modRana, Tiny Tiny RSS). Backup and restore for moving to another phone.
 Designed and written by Claude (Anthropic) together with smyhu.
